{"3497280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Canvas Infernum", "steam_appid": 3497280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome painter, to an afterlife not yet defined. An unshaped hell awaiting your peculiar vision. Your tools are tiles inspired by the greatest masterpieces and surreal works of Renaissance masters. Will your canvas reflect torment, redemption, or something even stranger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would this endless task be your punishment—or your magnum opus? Challenge yourself in this tile placement mechanic inspired by classic board games such as Carcassonne with a unique twist: dark pacts that alter the very fabric of the game, offering unique combinations and challenges with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a hell landscape of your own by combining tiles inspired by the works of Hieronymus Bosch and other Renaissance works. Uncover new pact cards and make your own strategy at every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What shall be the fate of the damned? Is redemption possible, or is sin an eternal burden? Assist demons in their grim duty to judge sinners. Your choices will shape not just the canvas, but the very fate of your journey, unlocking upgrades retained for later sessions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome painter, to an afterlife not yet defined. An unshaped hell awaiting your peculiar vision. Your tools are tiles inspired by the greatest masterpieces and surreal works of Renaissance masters. Will your canvas reflect torment, redemption, or something even stranger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/15ab1da052f3fe79658c2837cb1f3627.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would this endless task be your punishment—or your magnum opus? Challenge yourself in this tile placement mechanic inspired by classic board games such as Carcassonne with a unique twist: dark pacts that alter the very fabric of the game, offering unique combinations and challenges with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/f73311c7e698113ad21613e0079f3b98.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a hell landscape of your own by combining tiles inspired by the works of Hieronymus Bosch and other Renaissance works. Uncover new pact cards and make your own strategy at every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.poster.avif?t=1780621019\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.webm?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/extras/05256fcd286320f594fa10f13b0ca71f.mp4?t=1780621019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What shall be the fate of the damned? Is redemption possible, or is sin an eternal burden? Assist demons in their grim duty to judge sinners. Your choices will shape not just the canvas, but the very fate of your journey, unlocking upgrades retained for later sessions.</p>", "short_description": "Shape Hell according to your morals by placing tiles with real artwork, or become eternally damned. Craft a masterpiece to last forever and keep Satan from fading from human memory. Discover countless combos, forge bonds with demon lords, and unveil the mysteries of a strategy roguelike penance.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/af495becc286a75943e451b3012ec63a904d40d3/header.jpg?t=1780621019", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/065d632c16de6b25a6158af1f8c182d3a1846a0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780621019", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497280/065d632c16de6b25a6158af1f8c182d3a1846a0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780621019", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong